            "mode": "self_check",
            "prompt": "Which man-made source of NOx is the largest, and how can it be reduced?",
            "explanation": "Burning fossil fuels in vehicles and power plants. Vehicle emissions are cut by three-way catalytic converters that reduce NO to nitrogen, and by lowering combustion temperatures; power plants use catalytic reduction of their flue gases."
